  "name": "DP Value Pack 1",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Blister packs sold at Wal-Mart and Target from September 2007, among the largest of their kind, each with five booster packs (two Diamond & Pearl, and one each of EX Power Keepers, EX Crystal Guardians and EX Holon Phantoms) and an Energy coin. The blue pack held a cosmos holofoil Mew δ and the red pack a cosmos holofoil Pikachu, both from POP Series 5 and found in no POP pack, which held only non-holo copies of the set's rares. Copies of both turn up with the back printed upside down against the front.",
